comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T15:30:11.380Z",pi-agent,Updated every CodeQL action to the 4.37.9 SHA and grouped github/codeql-action* updates. Reverting both configuration edits made the focused regression test fail with exit 1; restoration passed. npm test passed 353 tests; the configured coverage gate passed; docstring and typecheck passed.
files[3]{path,scope,note}:
